<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraq's parliament approved the al-Zaidi cabinet while the government continued to detain seven Ukrainians suspected of plotting an attack on Persian Gulf oil facilities. Turkish foreign minister met OIC foreign ministers in Baghdad for the 52nd session, and Iraqi officials hosted multiple diplomatic talks on de-escalation and regional cooperation. The Kurdistan Region reported a more investor-friendly climate in a US report and Italy prepared to resume military training and intelligence cooperation with Kurdish forces. The Pentagon lowered its count of Iran war dead and wounded, prompting questions. 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxONm9md2lxTWQ2OHhpbWV0TGVpVHNvRE94ejRhQmFaejFzOEFwNzF5ZG1YbXI4MDVJQU9UMGtZdEo4dUxmQ25Vc2Q3OU9qM1hWWDg4UTRoX3FSLTRxa1h3OFBFZnR2WGF1OUVtcEtNZ2dtRlpZQkpBdjF1NE9tdk93RGpRaGtfQnJYbktVeUQ4eGlXcjZHR2RmZHQtX1pVNWZ5Yi11TTdZSTFpdHBmcWItR29YM2xrSEVha0ZST2dTTnBFNkE1U2VvWk1rQnU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/16/iraq-parliament-approves-al-zaidis-cabinet-amid-growing-economic-concerns&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNMm53LU5teDVOTEc1ZUhYT2g1NEJuV3pKZzFWZDFCS092RmJpdjA5VHdGT1BQenNTN0w0WlJuT0VUZVk1NWtpSUN5MWtxSFgyRWZNN2h6WlRvZ3VMbFpxMHRnQ1YtbGxJYmhYOVBOeS1RVHZ4amVEaTI3Q2VNdE5xRC1fUUZQblBSOXFNM1N6VGEycHd5MWQ0QjFnQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNc2hIaVlGdG5CRUY0Uk4zT0FGaFFOSFlfWU9CMDF4ZXhhQVQ3XzlPdWFSenBzS0ZabEcyLXYwdzZWTW5KWnFPbDNicGJpYlhPZlVjZ2NQYWtCMHBPemRVaFJHQlFoVXpUeUhLcTdBTDR2Sks0NUhPRkxyOE1CalRUVG9XMG5seURTal9hOGJsMktXOFNrN09TM0YxcGVENkVVclFwbDZ2QUhQMTJoekh0SEhR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ahram Online&lt